# Make a character and get into the dungeon. Included by every other script.
#
# The character is a standard male orc barbarian, neutral, worshipping
# whichever god the game offers. Orc barbarian is deliberate: it is the
# hardiest starting combination the game recommends to a new player, so a
# scripted walk survives long enough to be worth watching.
#
# Every choice here is a menu letter, and menu letters move when the list
# changes. Run with a fixed seed (tools/headless.sh <script> <seed>) or the
# attribute rolls change, the offered feats change with them, and these
# letters choose something else.

a       # Initial Choices: [a] Create a New Character
n       # Alter the character generation options? -- no
y       # Your options will place the game in Explore Mode. Continue? -- yes
i       # Race:     [i] Orc
a       # Subrace:  [a] Orc (Standard)
g       # Class:    [g] Priest
a       # Attributes: the first of the five offered sets
c       # Alignment: [c] Neutral
a       # First feat
a       # Second feat

# Skill Manager, twice: once for the class pool and once for the pool that
# follows the choice of god. RIGHT spends a rank on the selected skill and
# stops at the skill's maximum, DOWN moves to the next skill, so three RIGHTs
# per skill spends everything available without needing to know how many
# ranks this character has. Character generation will not let go until the
# pool is empty.
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y # Done, and confirm keeping the ranks

y       # Do you wish to worship <god>? -- yes

RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y

# The next keystroke lands in the dungeon, in play mode.

# A priest has more to choose than a barbarian: two further feats, and a third
# pool of skill ranks that only appears once the god is known.
a a
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y

a       # Personality archetype

# Four starting spells.
a a a a
